kien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":8,"closed_issues":4466,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-02-14T11:52:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T23:48:31Z","due_on":"2025-03-03T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T09:35:35Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2024-12-19T15:23:16Z","updated_at":"2024-12-20T02:11:28Z","closed_at":"2024-12-20T02:11:21Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible from v4.4.dev.mono.custom_build [190ae9f9d]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.dev.mono (190ae9f9d) - Ubuntu 24.04.1 LTS 24.04 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 3 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon Graphics (RADV RENOIR) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800H with Radeon Graphics (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nUsing a `PointLight2D` with shadow enabled leads to:\n\n```\nERROR: Can't allocate memory for buffer of size: 0, error -3.\nERROR: servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:749 - Condition \"!buffer.driver_id\" is true. Returning: RID()\nERROR: Storage buffer supplied (binding: 0) must provide one ID (0 provided).\nERROR: Buffer argument is not a valid buffer of any type.\nERROR: servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:4436 - Parameter \"uniform_set\" is null.\n```\n\nin the editor output and\n\n```\nE 0:00:00:0439   buffer_create: Can't allocate memory for buffer of size: 0, error -3.\n  <C++ Error>    Condition \"err\" is true. Returning: BufferID()\n  <C++ Source>   drivers/vulkan/rendering_device_driver_vulkan.cpp:1530 @ buffer_create()\n\nE 0:00:00:0439   storage_buffer_create: Condition \"!buffer.driver_id\" is true. Returning: RID()\n  <C++ Source>   servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:749 @ storage_buffer_create()\n\nE 0:00:00:0439   uniform_set_create: Storage buffer supplied (binding: 0) must provide one ID (0 provided).\n  <C++ Error>    Condition \"uniform.get_id_count() != 1\" is true. Returning: RID()\n  <C++ Source>   servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:3640 @ uniform_set_create()\n\nE 0:00:00:0439   buffer_update: Buffer argument is not a valid buffer of any type.\n  <C++ Error>    Parameter \"buffer\" is null.\n  <C++ Source>   servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:487 @ buffer_update()\n\nE 0:00:00:0439   draw_list_bind_uniform_set: Parameter \"uniform_set\" is null.\n  <C++ Source>   servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:4436 @ draw_list_bind_uniform_set()\n```\n\nin the debugger.\n\nThe culprit seems to be #100302.\n\nDoes not happen with `Compatibility` render mode. Only tested on Ubuntu 24.04.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a point light, add a light texture, and enable shadow. The errors will start to appear immediately in the output.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18199708/mrp.zip)\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{